  "note": "Confidence LOW. Month-only window. Indramayu is downstream in the Jatiluhur/PJT II system and its golongan start late. The 2024/25 rendeng officially began 1 Dec 2024, and Bulog reported further slippage in Jan 2026 from golongan changes. Most MT I planting is therefore likely AFTER the data window. Within Jun-Nov 2026 the visible crop is gadu (MT II), which had drought stress: 10,673 ha threatened with puso in Jul 2026 (https://en.republika.co.id/berita/tik5k3415/10673-hectares-of-rice-crops-in-indramayu-threatened-with-crop-failure-due-to-drought). Consider judging Indramayu against gadu or late planting rather than the rendeng onset."
